@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Figure 6 (v1). Event triggering and game completion sequence
caption Version 1 · 30 October 2026 · superseded by version 2 (12 November 2026). Redrawn from the original PlantUML; content unchanged.
participant Game
participant Player
participant Event
participant Score
Game -> Game : checkForEvents()
Game -> Player : getLocation()
Player --> Game : location
Game -> Event : isInTriggerRange(location)
Event --> Game : result
alt Event in range
  Game -> Game : activateEvent()
  Game -> Event : trigger()
  Game -> Event : affectPlayer(Player)
  Game -> Event : affectGeese(geese)
  Game -> Event : modifyScore(Score)
end
Game -> Game : checkForWin()
Game -> Score : isAllDispersed()
Score --> Game : result
alt All geese dispersed
  Game -> Game : endGame()
end
@enduml
